# Design Token Synchronization Rule

1. `design-tokens/wireline.tokens.json` is the single source of truth for all color, metric, motion, and typography tokens.
2. After modifying tokens, run `node scripts/build-design-tokens.mjs`. It regenerates the web TypeScript and CSS, browser extension CSS, shared and app iOS Swift, and Android Kotlin files. The generator defines their output paths.
3. Verify with `node scripts/check-design-token-parity.mjs` before committing.
